      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I absolutely second this, there would be significantly more people gifting VRC+ if this was a feature, including me.\n\nFor me, it's very tedious to do a manual transaction for each gift I would like to give out. Having a non refundable \"gift credits\" or \"gift tokens\" I can purchase in advance and give out when I see fit would be much more convenient. Especially if bulk discounts like how discounts on regular gift drop work I would definitely purchase a hundred or two at a time, then give out periodically at events until they're gone. Right now I don't see any legitimate reason to purchase a 100 gift drop bundle. It's not feasible to get a 100 player instance to drop in, and I much rather give 100 random people a subscription than give a few a bunch of months, since it would be more impactful that way.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-06-11T18:34:49.560Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, when a user purchases a VRC+ Gift Drop bundle (10, 50, 100, etc.), the entire bundle must be dropped at once.\n\nI would like users to be able to choose how many gifts they want to distribute from a bundle while keeping the remaining gifts for later use.\n\nFor example, in my case, I have gifted more than 60 months of VRC+ over the last two months. If I could purchase a bundle of 100 gifts at the discounted price, I would like to be able to:\n\nDrop 5 gifts during one event.\n\nDrop 10 gifts the following week.\n\nDrop 20 gifts during another event.\n\nKeep the remaining gifts for future events, giveaways, or community rewards.\n\nInstead, the current system forces users to distribute all 100 gifts at the same time, which significantly reduces the usefulness of larger bundles.\n\nA simple solution would be:\n\nPurchase a bundle of 10, 50, or 100 gifts.\n\nDisplay the remaining number of gifts on the account.\n\nAllow users to choose exactly how many gifts to drop each time.\n\nAutomatically keep the unused gifts for future Gift Drops.\n\nThis would be especially useful for event organizers, community leaders, streamers, content creators, and users who regularly gift VRC+ to others.\n\nIt would also encourage more users to purchase larger bundles since they could benefit from the discounted pricing without being forced to distribute every gift at once.",
